{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47155","headline":"宿郑谏议山居 · 昙域","name":"宿郑谏议山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堂开星斗边，大谏采薇还。\n禽隐石中树，月生池上山。\n凉风吹咏思，幽语隔禅关。\n莫拟归城计，终妨此地闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"昙域","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}